  "published": "2026-08-15T21:37:15.3Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "ADDED\n- `Initialize(string apiKey, string appUserId)` is now exposed on `IRevenueCatBilling`. It has been implemented on the concrete class since v4.5.0 (#40) but never surfaced on the interface, so DI consumers could not call it. Prefer it when the user's ID is already known at startup - no anonymous user (`$RCAnonymousID:...`) is created, so no alias is added on a later `Login`. #122\n\nBREAKING\n- `IRevenueCatBilling` has a new member: binary-breaking if you implement the interface yourself (e.g. a hand-rolled test fake); transparent for callers and dynamic mocks (NSubstitute/Moq).",
